                                                "sense_id": "d3f0821f-2398-336d-997d-0d98c2a0d563",
                                                "text": "With the recent advance in London yellow crystals, however, the disproportion of the relative value of these two kinds has been considerably reduced, and a better demand for crystallized raws should consequently occur."
