                                                "sense_id": "d3f0821f-2398-336d-997d-0d98c2a0d563",
                                                "text": "The world sugar contract closed 1 to 3 points net higher, with sales of only 36 lots. London raws sold at 8s. 4½d., and futures there were unchanged to 3d. higher."
